sketch-orca oracle patch 0002: the seed knob, SKETCH_ORCA_ORACLE_SEED.
Modified for Sketch, 2026-11-06.

With SKETCH_ORCA_ORACLE_SEED set to a whole number from 0 to 4294967295, the oracle seeds the two
generators the engine seeds from entropy with it:
- fuzzy skin's thread_local std::mt19937 (Feature/FuzzySkin/FuzzySkin.cpp:24-30), in place of
  std::random_device (or the thread id's hash);
- the placeholder parser's std::mt19937 (GCode.cpp:2707), in place of high_resolution_clock.
rand() keeps the UCRT's default seed of 1 on each thread: no srand call is added. The srand of
Fill/Lightning/Generator.cpp:34 follows the clock knob (patch 0001). A value that is not such a
number stops the oracle before it does anything else, with exit code 78. Unset, nothing changes.

---
